      "sourceTextSha256": "a11035d4ca896f4863f5f9314471791e1818d685d18b1eddda72b3bb4605e10f",
      "text": "Day 3 · After breakfast, a journey to Mindo, a charming town in one of Ecuador’s most scenic and biodiverse regions, home to some 500 bird species and over 400 species of orchids. Visit a butterfly farm, among orchids and hummingbirds; cross the forest canopy by cable car (tarabita), about 30 metres above the ground, and enjoy a walk in the forest, with optional zip-lining for the adventurous. End the day with a chocolate tour, following the bean-to-bar process. (B)",
